{"id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-reachability.md","title":"Epsilon Closure","display":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","aliases":["73-df-epsilon-reachability","73-df-epsilon-closure"],"display":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-reachability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-reachability</span><span>73-df-epsilon-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (epsilon-NFA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_Q\\)</span> (reflexive transitive closure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}\n\\quad(S\\subseteq Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}\n\\quad(S\\subseteq Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(q)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\n\\quad(q\\in Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(q)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\n\\quad(q\\in Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reflexivity includes every starting state; transitivity accounts for every finite sequence of epsilon transitions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}$ (epsilon-NFA, see [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_Q$ (reflexive transitive closure on $Q$, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}\n\\quad(S\\subseteq Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M(q)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\n\\quad(q\\in Q)","display":true}],"bytes":1157,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce790f46cab0681e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{